+// ==================== TD-003 INSTRUMENTATION (not production) ====================
+// Added to a COPY OUTSIDE THE REPOSITORY (CLAUDE.md section 2). Purpose: decompose
+// |sum Y - 1| into the part the linear SOLVE is responsible for and the part the assembled
